rom 1971.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/toera"><span class="enc-name">Toera</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Toera was the last king of the Sakalava kingdom of Menabe in western Madagascar.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/tofangchi"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/tofangchi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Tofangchi</span><span class="enc-type">Institution</span><span class="enc-snip">Tofangchi were musketeers in the armies of Safavid and later Iranian states.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/toffa-i"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/toffa-i.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Toffa I</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Toffa I was king of Porto-Novo, on the coast of present-day Benin, from 1874 until his death in 1908.</span></a></li></ul>
